#: ops/tasks.py:164
msgid ""
"Due to exceptions caused by executing adhoc and playbooks in the Job "
"Center, \n"
"        which result in the task status not being updated, the system will "
"clean up abnormal jobs \n"
"        that have not been completed for more than 3 hours every hour and "
"mark these tasks as \n"
"        failed"
msgstr ""
"Since executing quick commands or playbooks in the job center may produce "
"anomalies where task status is not updated to complete, the system will run "
"hourly to clean up anomalous jobs that have not completed for over 3 hours "
"and mark those tasks as failed."

