"retention period every day \n"
"        at 2 a.m., based on the configuration of 'System Settings - Tasks - "
"Regular clean-up - \n"
"        Job execution retention days'"
msgstr ""
"When the Job Center executes quick commands or playbooks, execution records "
"are generated. Based on the System Settings > Task List > Periodic Cleanup > "
"Job Center Execution History configuration, the system cleans up records "
"that have exceeded the retention time every day at 2:00 AM."

